			9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5, 9, § 70</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sil. 8,
			579</span></i>.— Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pīcentīnus</span></b> ,
